{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16314041","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16314041","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1631404101:1":{"text":"みんな、静かにしてくれ！今日は大事な話し合いを行う！","source_cn":"大家安静一下，咱们今天要商量大事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B8465CF5126E2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1631404102:1":{"text":"大事な話って、何？まさか、新しい干物の隠し場所でも見つけたの！？","source_cn":"什么大事啊煤球？是不是发现了新的小鱼干存放地点？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651BF5BAEA80C267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631404103:1":{"text":"それよりもっと重要だ！よく聞け、僕たちは<style=\"highlight\">ねこねこサービス商会</style>を立ち上げる！二本足をターゲットに、がっつり稼ぐんだ！","source_cn":"比那还重要！我们要开一家<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FC479D2AA2DE007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631404104:1":{"text":"ニャ……二本足？あの大きな生き物だよね？彼らにサービスを提供するの？","source_cn":"喵……两脚兽？那些大型生物？我们为他们提供服务？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26405F3528BBB795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631404105:1":{"text":"その通り！どうやら二本足は、僕らのことが好きみたいだ。それにいつも「お金」ってやつを持ち歩いてる。ならば僕らの魅力を使って、その「お金」を手に入れれば、僕らの夢を実現できる！","source_cn":"没错！我观察到两脚兽似乎特别喜欢我们，而且他们总是带着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5438B9A83DB89129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631404106:1":{"text":"食べきれないほどの缶詰に、世界一周……それに伝説の干物工場も見学できるの！？","source_cn":"比如吃不完的罐头？遨游世界？还有……参观传说中的鱼干工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89BD3F80104943D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631404107:1":{"text":"そうだ！あとは、どのようなサービスを提供するかなんだが……","source_cn":"对呀！重点是，我们需要想出能为两脚兽提供哪些服务……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5B1B76C84F681D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631404108:1":{"text":"うーん……「お布団あっためサービス」とか？二本足は、ボクが足元で寝ると喜ぶみたいだから！","source_cn":"唔……我可以提供暖被窝服务，两脚兽似乎喜欢我在他们脚边睡觉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A0C80EC61F12885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1631404109:1":{"text":"うん、あとは「ねこ付き添いサービス」ってのもありだな。二本足があのヘンな液体を飲むとき、近くにいて撫でさせてやると喜ぶだろ。","source_cn":"我们还可以提供猫咪陪伴服务，就是两脚兽喝奇怪液体时，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4BB2971C0F188D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631404110:1":{"text":"け……毛玉だらけの魔法ローブ、レンタルサービスとか……","source_cn":"我……我可以免费赠送沾满毛球的法袍……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9D0A6DC788A449","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631404111:1":{"text":"なんだそれ……ダメだ、却下！","source_cn":"咦……这条不行，作废！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BEAE4067AB7B419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631404112:1":{"text":"ニャゥ……もう、こうなったら何でもするわよ！干物のために！","source_cn":"喵呜……不管了，总之，为了小鱼干！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE35B94FDCF3DB1D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1631404113:1":{"text":"自由のために！","source_cn":"为了自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6A13EE464D6321E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1631404114:0":{"text":"そして夢のために！ねこねこサービス商会、ここに発足だ！","source_cn":"为了梦想！猫猫服务商会，正式成立！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566DBAA59F042A07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑猫煤球":{"text":"黒猫のタドン","source":"黑猫煤球","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:橘猫橙子":{"text":"茶トラのダイダイ","source":"橘猫橙子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:白猫小白":{"text":"白猫のブラン","source":"白猫小白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}